    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d293">

                <pb facs="0290" n="280" sameAs="frus:frus1941v05/pg280"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">892.248/45: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Thailand</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Grant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-08-22T18:00:00-04:00">August 22, 1941—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>107. Your 342, July 13<anchor n="71" xml:id="d293-f1"/> and 350, July 17. The
                    President has approved an award of $13,161.52, with interest at the rate of 4
                    percent, from March 11, 1941 to August 19, 1941, for the 24 machine guns
                    requisitioned by this Government. In all probability a decision will be reached
                    in connection with the aircraft within the next 2 weeks.<anchor n="72"
                        xml:id="d293-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d293-f1" n="71" xml:id="d293-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d293-f2" n="72" xml:id="d293-f2-content">
                <p>In telegram No. 163, December 3, 6 p.m., the Department reported to the Minister
                    in Thailand that it had been informed by the Thai Minister on December 1 “that
                    he had now received from this Government full payment of the awards for the
                    requisitioned aircraft in question.” (892.248/56)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
